{
  "id": "zoo-visit",
  "title": "和家人逛動物園",
  "titleEn": "Visiting the Zoo with Family",
  "category": "休閒生活",
  "level": "入門",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/zoo-visit.webp",
    "alt": "在陽光明媚的週末，一家四口走在綠意盎然的動物園步道上，孩子們興奮地指著圍欄裡吃樹葉的高大長頸鹿與龐大的大象，媽媽拿著相機面帶微笑準備為大家拍照。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "On Sunday, my family walks happily into the "
        },
        {
          "text": "zoo",
          "wordIds": [
            "zoo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "星期天，我和家人開心地走進動物園。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/zoo-visit/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "2bdc7b627ff281326da202469a5a9c817d975c4e775dc4a7df0cb24c85f12e14",
        "sha256": "de06a31ad5d3fe6cb61cb78f81234d02ce32e05b2228a157f32d54ab3b850e59"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "We are excited to visit every friendly "
        },
        {
          "text": "animal",
          "wordIds": [
            "animal"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "我們很興奮能拜訪每一隻友善的動物。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/zoo-visit/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "b0ef5fe5c95d6c7500e5ea50c813592b8f886b2a7854f6a1477ca5aa7782d07f",
        "sha256": "f578511eef882a3bea5e525479e87d3d9e2cbe6bfc533227690962ac5a60e164"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "We watch giraffes eat green leaves, and I say, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "the-giraffe-is-so-tall"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "giraffe",
          "phraseIds": [
            "the-giraffe-is-so-tall"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "giraffe"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is so ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "the-giraffe-is-so-tall"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tall",
          "phraseIds": [
            "the-giraffe-is-so-tall"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "tall"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "the-giraffe-is-so-tall"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "我們看著長頸鹿吃綠葉，我說：「長頸鹿好高喔。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/zoo-visit/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "30a1b083e6e0610f7b45f32ef28701b348aec72c34e479b001a2974d19017981",
        "sha256": "06eed67919ea4bf76d880f5ace81a56437ecfaaf10a39601a412d00506ead2e5"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Then my little brother points and shouts, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look at the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-at-the-elephant"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elephant",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-at-the-elephant"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "elephant"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-at-the-elephant"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "接著我弟弟指著並喊道：「看那隻大象！」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/zoo-visit/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "e247c1c7f05dea95620ad5a005c677e294475958e93976f564384143e4aac612",
        "sha256": "b59e45e20ccaa6e290763a02270a1f4cbc33af3cc7c3ce45fc190d97d231b903"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom holds up her camera and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Can we take a ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-we-take-a-picture"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "picture",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-we-take-a-picture"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "picture"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-we-take-a-picture"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽舉起相機問：「我們可以拍張照嗎？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/zoo-visit/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "e87b9970b3af99920a69291953dac00047151cfad4c457b3c7823c1c01a4021a",
        "sha256": "87c0b9fb8fa0bafe89e242b97b6b449cd51d6a094d41a72f2e4a3be84a4e4a2e"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "We all smile together for the camera, and I say, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I love the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-love-the-zoo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "zoo",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-love-the-zoo"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "zoo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-love-the-zoo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "我們大家一起對著鏡頭微笑，我說：「我好喜歡動物園！」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/zoo-visit/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "3a151b513dc7b6a3e74644cb941b461e0f37b8e9587b70cb73bdc27406f23a60",
        "sha256": "1a7e85a1a6df1d2f72b3f5a1f7009a317c8416e0489595e0669c0157fa1d7b51"
      }
    }
  ],
